        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-01T05:59:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's probably pretty well understood by the playerbase that Baron Blade can't exceed his maximum HP post-flip; the Phosphorescent Chamber version of the question would only apply to Fanatic's Aegis and Apostate.&nbsp; (Also where did you get 41 for the Baron?&nbsp; He never flips back to his 40-HP original that I've ever heard of.)</p>",
