        "created_at": "2014-01-23T17:55:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Looking through this thread there are some that I think have been answered that aren't labelled as such, and others that still remain unanswered (I think)</p><p>Most rule debates have died down since the Timing Rule tweak.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Post #20: &nbsp;Whether modification to recovery affects restoring HP. &nbsp;Still unanswered I believe.</p><p>Are any of the other ones unanswered?</p><p>The list from post #1 I think all of those have been answered except for healing modification.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just a reminder this thread is not for debating rules, so let's stick to whether there is an official ruling or not.</p>",
